# Copy to .env and fill in to enable LLM-backed answer correction and chat
# via Groq's free API (https://console.groq.com/keys). Without this file (or
# without GROQ_API_KEY set some other way), correction falls back to the
# deterministic diff-based grader and chat reports itself unavailable —
# nothing breaks, the app just tolerates fewer paraphrases and has no tutor.

GROQ_API_KEY=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

# Optional. Defaults to openai/gpt-oss-120b, a free, fast model that
# handles both structured grading and open-ended chat well. Any model listed
# at https://console.groq.com/docs/models works.
# GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
